    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, are you sure about 7,889,001? I had our lead engineer look at that one briefly and he said it's mostly about localized hardware stabilization, whereas our tech is specifically focused on high-density computing with the integrated ceramic substrate. It seems like a different application entirely. \n\nIf we stall now, we might miss this funding round. Is there any way we can frame our micro-channel etching or the specific substrate integration as enough of a \"distinction\" to move forward with the filing anyway? I'd rather file and argue the novelty later than lose the momentum now.",
