      "content": "I hear you on the risk, but I'm serious about the urgency here. If we wait for a full legal review, the window for this round might close and we're dead in the water. \n\nLook, from an IP strategy standpoint, can't we just focus the filing specifically on the micro-channel etching process within the ceramic substrate? If we narrow the scope of our claims to just that specific manufacturing method, does 7,889,001 still pose a major threat to our chances of getting a patent granted? I just need to know if we can realistically push this through by Friday to keep the investors happy.",
